license: MIT

abstract: >
  A small, typed decision grammar for analytical work. composable-data-core
  provides shared declarations for analytical meaning, consequential decisions
  and rationale, experimental evidence, and conclusions. It records analytical
  structure without performing analytical operations.

keywords:
